This is a fan-made Java/Fabric port of gameplay mechanics originally designed
for the "AFK Farms Add-On" Bedrock Edition addon by ldz_241216. No original
Bedrock assets (scripts, models, textures) are redistributed here except
where explicitly copied and re-licensed by the port's author for this project
(see README.md for details on what was copied vs. rebuilt).
